      "value": "@{5ae12cd29050d4168a19f5e2|full_name}: This is a bug because until this latest update you were able to use the Blueprint ID to overwrite an avatar slot (in fact it works the same for worlds). Either to update an existing avatar or put another avatar in its spot. I am not sure you fully understand how the blueprint ID system works for VRChat. Here: https://docs.vrchat.com/v1.0/docs/publishing-content",
